Protection orders-effective during appeal or
SF0008
review.
Sponsored By: Joint Judiciary Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to protection orders; specifying the applicability of stalking,
sexual assault and domestic violence protection orders during appeal or review;
and providing for an effective date.
